# Dynamo_ExistingGondolaPlacement
# Revit 2025 / Dynamo CPython3 compatible
#
# Places existing-condition gondolas from the JSON generated by
# Gondola_OrientationDetector.py.
#
# Tracing / rotation notes
# ------------------------
# Use placement_angle / orientation_angle from JSON. Do NOT use the DXF
# TEXT rotation field — that is the glyph baseline, not the bay axis.
# Coordinates are mapped through the selected CAD import transform
# (origin, rotation, and scale) so the family lands on the linked plan.

